          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Heat, at flat plate collector, multiple dwelling, for hot water
Use of a solar system excluding the necessary auxiliary heating.;
UUID: 3100dcab-dc76-36b3-b870-b6bba1171a66
Delivery of heat with a solar system including maintenance and electricity use for operation. Excluding the necessary auxiliary heating.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Operation of a solar system, not including the necessary additional heating.
Time period: Time of simulation.
Production volume: Total solar heat delivered by flat plate collectors in 2001 was 37TJ.
Sampling: Simulation done by SPF Rapperswil with Polysun 3.3 computer programme. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3100dcab-dc76-36b3-b870-b6bba1171a66.xml</text>
